{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25480","headline":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 叠石 · 李德裕","name":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 叠石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潺湲桂水湍，漱石多奇状。\n鳞次冠烟霞，蝉联叠波浪。\n今来碧梧下，迥出秋潭上。\n岁晚苔藓滋，怀贤益惆怅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}